---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Approach" description="Great care starts with a doctor who knows you.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
      <h1>Great care starts with<br>a doctor who knows you.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Most people have never had a doctor who truly knows them. At Foundation, we do things differently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c116495ccc6af5cfee082d_foundation-clinic-approach12.webp" alt="Foundation Clinic approach" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <p style="font-size: var(--body-lg); color: var(--fg-1); line-height: 1.7;">Most people have never had a doctor who truly knows them. They move between providers, repeat their history, and hope the pieces add up.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 20px;">At Foundation, we do things differently. One doctor, a genuine relationship, and full responsibility for your health — from everyday acute appointments to preventative care and specialist coordination.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Our services are available to our members, as we want to ensure that every patient gets the time, attention, and continuity that good medicine requires.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="membership-model">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c1164a036b6533a4f71fe1_foundation-clinic-approach7.webp" alt="Membership model" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Membership model</span>
          <h2>Your whole health,<br>for the long term.</h2>
          <p>Our membership model allows guaranteed access to your doctor, data-driven prevention, and seamless coordination of care instead of isolated appointments.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">At Foundation, you are matched with a doctor who takes full responsibility of your health goals and concerns.</p>
          <a href="/memberships" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">View pricing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="coordinated-care">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69b654aa5269f9cb772aecd8_FoundationClinic_interior_9.jpg" alt="Coordinated care" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Coordinated care</span>
          <h2>Full responsibility<br>of your health.</h2>
          <p>Patients usually receive care from multiple providers: tests are ordered in one place, specialists consulted in another, and medical records remain fragmented across systems.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">A core part of our approach is coordinating these pieces into a coherent plan. When needed, we identify the appropriate specialists, coordinate referrals, and take care of scheduling, invoicing and insurance claims for you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="care-anywhere">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c11649054b4e5df5837b26_foundation-clinic-approach14.webp" alt="Care anywhere" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Care anywhere</span>
          <h2>Best possible care,<br>wherever you are.</h2>
          <p>Healthcare should fit around your life. In addition to consultations at our clinic, we offer remote appointments, visits at home or at the workplace.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">When you're abroad, your doctor connects you with local specialists as needed, ensuring you always receive timely and the best possible care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="medical-data">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c11724e82111f75ffcd7da_39fd90829fb96b6481042b9e8c518705_foundation-clinic-approach10.webp" alt="Medical data" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Medical data</span>
          <h2>All your data<br>in one place.</h2>
          <p>Before your onboarding consultation and with your consent, we review your previous medical history, laboratory results, medications, imaging, and other relevant information.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">All information is organised and stored in one place as a continuous timeline. You never have to tell your story from the beginning again.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-espresso">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2>Contact us to explore how we can support your long-term health.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">We answer all emails within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>